Description: Do not show a banner on restored documents.
 Text Editor shows "Document Restored" above every restored document which was never saved to a file, and "Draft
 Changes Restored" above every restored document with unsaved changes to a file. With restore-window-placement.patch,
 documents return with their unsaved content and their windows at every start, so keeping a document unsaved is a
 normal way to use Text Editor, and the banners mark every such window as needing attention. The window title still
 shows whether a document is unsaved or modified.
Author: Mitar
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-11-04
